Re=217k report is the case that includes L/D = 11.5 as reported on CV.
Re=150k report has L/D = 9. 
To run either case, adjust velocity in 0/include/initialConditions and system/forceCoeffs accordingly as well as corresponding wall-functions for omega and nut in each case.
The new commits change turbulentKE and turbulentOmega to match velocity for a 5% turbulence intensity inlet, which is used for urban air settings.
